  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<b>STANDARD PROTOCOL:</b>

    1. <b>Clean Platinum Wire:</b> Dip the
    wire loop into Conc. HCl and hold it in the hot zone of the flame until no color
    is produced.

    2. <b>Prepare Paste:</b> Place a pinch of salt on a clean watch
    glass, add a drop of Conc. HCl to form a moist paste.

    3. <b>Load & Test:</b>
    Dip the cleaned loop into the paste and hold it in the base/edge of the non-luminous
    flame.

    4. <b>Observe:</b> Record the characteristic flame color.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
